## What Are Network VA/PT Services?

Network Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VA/PT) is a cybersecurity process that identifies and evaluates security weaknesses in an organization's network infrastructure. Vulnerability assessment helps discover potential security issues, while penetration testing simulates authorized attacks to determine whether identified weaknesses can be exploited.

These assessments help organizations understand their security posture and take appropriate steps to protect critical business systems.

