## Key Features of Network VA/PT Services

Professional network VA/PT assessments may include network discovery, port and service analysis, vulnerability scanning, firewall configuration reviews, access control testing, and authorized penetration testing. Both internal and external network assessments can be conducted depending on the organization's requirements and agreed scope.

After testing, cybersecurity professionals provide a detailed report describing identified vulnerabilities, their severity, potential business impact, and recommended remediation measures. Retesting can help verify whether the reported issues have been resolved.

Regular assessments allow organizations to identify new weaknesses as their networks, applications, and infrastructure evolve.

